{"availability":"available","full":"morya-space/morya-ui","name":"morya-ui","description":"Open-source Vue 3 component library with 90+ components, design tokens, light/dark themes, TypeScript, and interactive docs.    开源 Vue 3 组件库：90+ 组件、设计令牌、亮暗主题、TypeScript、交互式文档。","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-19T06:35:19Z","updated":"2026-10-14T11:31:46Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://morya-space.github.io/morya-ui/","topics":["admin-dashboard","component-library","dark-mode","design-system","design-tokens","form-components","frontend","mcp","morya","morya-ui","tree-shaking","typescript","ui-components","ui-library","vite","vue","vue3"],"demo":"https://morya-space.github.io/morya-ui/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T15:50:08.782Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T15:50:08.782Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T15:50:08.782Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T07:35:27.852Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T19:00:30.900Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T15:50:08.782Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Vue"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A Vue 3 component library with design tokens, light/dark themes, and interactive docs.","Documentation · Components · Issues · Changelog","Morya UI (morya-ui) is an open-source Vue 3 component library for building modern web applications. It ships 90+ components, a token-based theme system, built-in i18n, and a documentation site with live previews."],"features":["90+ components covering basics, forms, navigation, data display, layout, and feedback — all tree-shakeable via ESM subpath imports.","Light and dark modes powered by --m- CSS variables. Switch themes with useTheme, tune density and motion with useDensity / useMotion, and override per subtree via MConfigProvider.","Written in Vue 3 Composition API + TypeScript. Props, emits, and locale messages are fully typed.","Use full registration, named imports, on-demand subpaths, or MoryaUIResolver with unplugin-vue-components — pick one style per app.","Every component includes Markdown docs with interactive vue preview blocks. Browse them online or run the docs site locally."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/morya-space/morya-ui/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9b996f6055ff2bf98abbcea4798788a8533f98e184726dfaa3cbf34ae11c655d","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:28.193Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:28.193Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A Vue 3 component library with design tokens, light/dark themes, and interactive docs.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/morya-space/morya-ui/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"9b996f6055ff2bf98abbcea4798788a8533f98e184726dfaa3cbf34ae11c655d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/morya-space/morya-ui/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:28.194Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T07:27:47Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/morya-space/morya-ui/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:28.194Z","hash":"9b996f6055ff2bf98abbcea4798788a8533f98e184726dfaa3cbf34ae11c655d","originalBytes":5422,"storedBytes":5422,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:27.852Z","subjects":["MCP servers & agents","Templates & UI components","Data & dashboards"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Design","subjects":["MCP servers & agents","Templates & UI components","Data & dashboards"],"evidence":[{"subject":"MCP servers & agents","source":"metadata","match":"mcp"},{"subject":"Templates & UI components","source":"metadata","match":"component library"},{"subject":"Data & dashboards","source":"metadata","match":"dashboard"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":[],"reviewRequired":false},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://morya-space.github.io/morya-ui/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-16T1